<title>PAKISTAN: Brooke Bond Pakistan 1st half net falls.</title>
<headline>Brooke Bond Pakistan 1st half net falls.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales			 1,991 vs 1,996</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	   199 vs   295</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	    133 vs   189</p>
<p>First interim dividend 35 pct vs 20 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Brooke Bond Pakistan Ltd. The company blames the decline in profits on tea smuggling into Pakistan. Book closure March 10-17.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
